  "body": "https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#initialize-global-object-csp is called at Step 6 in \"perform the fetch\" clause of Step 12 of [#run-a-worker](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/workers.html#run-a-worker), which uses worker global scope's owner set to inherit CSPs of the parent Document.\r\n\r\nHowever, the parent Document (that calls `new Worker()` etc.) is added to the worker global scope's owner set at Step 17 of [#run-a-worker](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/workers.html#run-a-worker), which is after the CSP initialization.\r\n\r\nThis is a very minor issue though.",
